<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Survival RPG: Pro 3D Game Engine & Level Editor</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.128.0/examples/js/loaders/GLTFLoader.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/three@0.128.0/examples/js/utils/SkeletonUtils.js"></script>
    <style>
        body { margin: 0; overflow: hidden; background-color: #050811; font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; user-select: none; }
        #game-container { display: block; width: 100vw; height: 100vh; position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; z-index: 1; }
        .ui-layer { position: absolute; z-index: 10; pointer-events: none; width: 100vw; height: 100vh; top: 0; left: 0; }
        .interactive { pointer-events: auto; }
        
        #floating-ui-container { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100vw; height: 100vh; pointer-events: none; z-index: 5; }
        .enemy-hp-bar { position: absolute; width: 44px; height: 5px; background: rgba(15,23,42,0.9); border: 1px solid #334155; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; display: none; }
        .enemy-hp-fill { height: 100%; background: #ef4444; width: 100%; transition: width 0.08s ease-out; }
        .enemy-boss-bar { width: 84px; height: 8px; border-color: #f59e0b; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(245,158,11,0.5); }
        .enemy-boss-fill { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f59e0b, #ef4444); }

        .floating-damage { 
            position: absolute; 
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%); 
            font-weight: 900; 
            font-size: 1.15rem; 
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #000, -1px -1px 0 #000, 1px -1px 0 #000, -1px 1px 0 #000; 
            pointer-events: none; 
            transition: opacity 0.2s;
        }
        .damage-crit { font-size: 1.7rem; color: #fbbf24 !important; text-shadow: 0 0 12px #f59e0b, 2px 2px 0 #000; }
        .damage-heal { font-size: 1.4rem; color: #10b981 !important; text-shadow: 0 0 10px #059669, 2px 2px 0 #000; }

        @keyframes damageFlash { 0% { box-shadow: inset 0 0 0px 0px rgba(255,0,0,0); } 50% { box-shadow: inset 0 0 140px 40px rgba(220,38,38,0.75); } 100% { box-shadow: inset 0 0 0px 0px rgba(255,0,0,0); } }
        .screen-flash { animation: damageFlash 0.28s ease-out; }

        .glass-panel {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.88);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        .scrollable-panel {
            max-height: calc(100vh - 170px);
            overflow-y: auto;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 5px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.4); }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #334155; border-radius: 4px; }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: #38bdf8; }

        input[type=range] { accent-color: #38bdf8; cursor: pointer; }
        input[type=color] { cursor: pointer; background: transparent; border: none; border-radius: 4px; }
        .engine-tab-active { border-bottom: 2px solid #38bdf8; color: #38bdf8; font-weight: bold; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); }

        .upgrade-card {
            transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        }
        .upgrade-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px) scale(1.02);
            border-color: #38bdf8;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3);
        }

        input[type=file]::file-selector-button {
            border: none;
            background: #2563eb;
            padding: 4px 8px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            color: white;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-right: 8px;
            transition: background 0.2s;
        }
        input[type=file]::file-selector-button:hover { background: #1d4ed8; }

        .menu-btn {
            transition: all 0.25s ease;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .menu-btn:hover {
            transform: translateX(6px);
            border-color: #38bdf8;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.25);
        }

        .tool-btn-active {
            background: #0284c7 !important;
            border-color: #38bdf8 !important;
            color: white !important;
            box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.5);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="text-slate-100 overflow-hidden">

    <div id="game-container"></div>
    <div id="floating-ui-container"></div>

    <div class="ui-layer" id="ui-root">
        
        <!-- ГЛАВНОЕ МЕНЮ -->
        <div id="main-menu" class="interactive absolute inset-0 bg-slate-950/90 backdrop-blur-md flex flex-col items-center justify-center z-50">
            <div class="text-center mb-10">
                <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-sky-500/10 border border-sky-500/20 text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-sky-400 font-extrabold mb-3">
                    <span>⚡ Next-Gen 3D Engine & Sandbox</span>
                </div>
                <h1 class="text-6xl font-black tracking-wider text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-400 via-indigo-300 to-amber-300 drop-shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(56,189,248,0.45)]">
                    SURVIVAL STUDIO
                </h1>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-3 max-w-md mx-auto">Полноценный движок: редактор сцен в реальном времени, разрушаемые объекты, аудио-синтезатор и настраиваемый ИИ.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="flex flex-col space-y-3.5 w-84">
                <button id="menu-btn-play" class="menu-btn py-4 px-6 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-500 to-indigo-600 hover:from-sky-400 hover:to-indigo-500 text-slate-950 font-black text-xl shadow-xl flex items-center justify-between">
                    <span class="flex items-center gap-2">⚔️️ Играть</span>
                    <span class="text-sm opacity-80">▶</span>
                </button>
                <button id="menu-btn-editor" class="menu-btn py-3.5 px-6 rounded-2xl glass-panel text-amber-300 font-bold text-lg flex items-center justify-between border border-amber-500/30 hover:border-amber-400">
                    <span class="flex items-center gap-2">🛠️ Редактор Уровней (Dev)</span>
                    <span class="text-xs uppercase px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300 font-mono">IDE</span>
                </button>
                <button id="menu-btn-settings" class="menu-btn py-3 px-6 rounded-2xl glass-panel text-white font-bold text-base flex items-center justify-between border border-slate-700">
                    <span class="flex items-center gap-2">⚙️ Настройки</span>
                    <span class="text-sm opacity-50">›</span>
                </button>
            </div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-6 text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium flex items-center gap-4">
                <span>Three.js + ECS Architecture</span>
                <span>•</span>
                <span>Realtime Physics & Raycast Gizmo</span>
                <span>•</span>
                <span>JSON Modding</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ОКНО НАСТРОЕК -->
        <div id="settings-modal" class="hidden interactive absolute inset-0 bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-md flex items-center justify-center z-50">
            <div class="glass-panel p-6 rounded-3xl w-96 border border-slate-700 shadow-2xl space-y-6">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center border-b border-slate-700 pb-3">
                    <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-sky-400 flex items-center gap-2">⚙️ Настройки звука и игры</h2>
                    <button id="btn-close-settings" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-white text-xl font-bold">&times;</button>
                </div>
                <div class="space-y-4">
                    <div class="space-y-1">
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center font-bold text-sm">
                            <span>🔊 Общая громкость SFX:</span>
                            <span id="label-volume" class="text-sky-400 font-mono">70%</span>
                        </div>
                        <input type="range" id="ctrl-volume" min="0" max="100" value="70" class="w-full">
                    </div>
                    <div class="space-y-1">
                        <div class="flex justify-between items-center font-bold text-sm">
                            <span>🎵 Синтезатор фоновой музыки:</span>
                            <span id="label-bgm" class="text-indigo-400 font-mono">ВКЛ</span>
                        </div>
                        <input type="range" id="ctrl-bgm-volume" min="0" max="100" value="40" class="w-full">
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between p-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 text-xs">
                        <span>Тени высокого разрешения:</span>
                        <input type="checkbox" id="ctrl-shadows" checked class="w-4 h-4 rounded">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="pt-2">
                    <button id="btn-save-settings" class="w-full py-3 bg-sky-500 hover:bg-sky-400 text-slate-950 font-black rounded-xl transition shadow-lg">
                        Готово
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ИГРОВОЙ ХУД -->
        <div id="gameplay-hud" class="hidden">
            <!-- Верхняя панель HUD -->
            <div class="absolute top-4 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 flex items-center space-x-4">
                <div class="glass-panel px-6 py-2 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl flex items-center space-x-6 text-center">
                    <div>
                        <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 font-bold">Волна</div>
                        <div id="hud-wave" class="text-2xl font-black text-amber-400">1</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="w-px h-8 bg-slate-700/60"></div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 font-bold">Врагов</div>
                        <div id="hud-enemies" class="text-2xl font-black text-rose-400">0</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="w-px h-8 bg-slate-700/60"></div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 font-bold">Уровень</div>
                        <div id="hud-level" class="text-2xl font-black text-sky-400">1</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="w-px h-8 bg-slate-700/60"></div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 font-bold">Очки</div>
                        <div id="hud-score" class="text-xl font-bold text-amber-300">0</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="w-px h-8 bg-slate-700/60"></div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400 font-bold">FPS</div>
                        <div id="hud-fps" class="text-xl font-bold text-emerald-400">60</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="interactive flex items-center space-x-2">
                    <button id="btn-hud-menu" class="glass-panel hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 font-bold px-3 py-3 rounded-2xl transition shadow-lg" title="Главное меню">
                        🏠
                    </button>
                    <button id="btn-toggle-engine" class="glass-panel hover:bg-slate-800 text-sky-400 border border-sky-500/40 font-bold px-4 py-3 rounded-2xl transition shadow-lg flex items-center space-x-2">
                        <span>🛠️</span>
                        <span class="text-sm tracking-wider uppercase font-black">Движок / Dev</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Полоска опыта XP -->
            <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-2.5 bg-slate-900 overflow-hidden shadow-inner">
                <div id="xp-bar" class="h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-500 via-indigo-400 to-amber-300 transition-all duration-150" style="width: 0%;"></div>
            </div>

            <!-- Панель навыков и оружия -->
            <div class="absolute bottom-20 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 flex items-center space-x-3">
                <div class="glass-panel px-4 py-2 rounded-xl flex items-center space-x-3 text-xs">
                    <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 font-mono font-bold text-amber-300 border border-slate-700">ПРОБЕЛ</span>
                    <span class="font-semibold text-slate-300">Рывок:</span>
                    <span id="cd-dash" class="font-bold text-emerald-400">ГОТОВ</span>
                </div>
                <div class="glass-panel px-4 py-2 rounded-xl flex items-center space-x-3 text-xs">
                    <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 font-mono font-bold text-sky-300 border border-slate-700">E</span>
                    <span class="font-semibold text-slate-300">Кольцо Мороза:</span>
                    <span id="cd-nova" class="font-bold text-emerald-400">ГОТОВ</span>
                </div>
                <div class="glass-panel px-4 py-2 rounded-xl flex items-center space-x-3 text-xs border border-indigo-500/30">
                    <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-indigo-950 font-mono font-bold text-indigo-300 border border-indigo-800">1-4</span>
                    <span class="font-semibold text-slate-300">Оружие:</span>
                    <span id="hud-weapon-name" class="font-black text-indigo-400">Винтовка</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Здоровье игрока -->
            <div class="absolute bottom-6 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2 w-[540px] max-w-[90vw]">
                <div class="glass-panel p-2 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl">
                    <div class="relative h-6 bg-slate-950 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-700">
                        <div id="hero-hp-fill" class="absolute top-0 left-0 h-full bg-gradient-to-r from-red-600 via-rose-500 to-pink-500 transition-all duration-150" style="width: 100%;"></div>
                        <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center text-xs tracking-wider uppercase font-black text-white drop-shadow">
                            <span id="hero-hp-text">100 / 100</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- РЕДАКТОР УРОВНЕЙ И ДВИЖОК (DEV STUDIO) -->
        <div id="engine-panel" class="hidden interactive absolute top-4 left-4 w-[430px] glass-panel rounded-2xl shadow-2xl p-4 flex flex-col border border-slate-700/80 transition-all duration-300 z-40">
            <!-- Заголовок панели студии -->
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center pb-2 border-b border-slate-700/60 mb-3">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                    <span class="p-1 rounded bg-sky-500/20 text-sky-400 text-sm font-mono font-black">DEV</span>
                    <span class="font-black text-sm tracking-wider uppercase text-sky-400">Studio & Level Editor</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-1.5">
                    <button id="btn-pause-engine" class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-xs font-bold rounded-lg transition" title="Пауза симуляции">⏸ Пауза</button>
                    <button id="btn-step-frame" class="px-2 py-1 bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-xs font-bold rounded-lg transition" title="Один шаг кадра">⏭ 1 кадр</button>
                    <button id="btn-close-engine" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-white text-lg font-bold px-1.5">&times;</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Вкладки студии -->
            <div id="tabs-container" class="flex border-b border-slate-800 text-[11px] mb-3 font-semibold text-slate-400 overflow-x-auto whitespace-nowrap cursor-pointer">
                <button class="tab-btn pb-2 px-2 engine-tab-active" data-tab="tab-builder">🧱 Строитель</button>
                <button class="tab-btn pb-2 px-2 hover:text-slate-200" data-tab="tab-inspector">🔍 Инспектор</button>
                <button class="tab-btn pb-2 px-2 hover:text-slate-200" data-tab="tab-hero">🧙 Герой / Оружие</button>
                <button class="tab-btn pb-2 px-2 hover:text-slate-200" data-tab="tab-waves">🌊 Волны</button>
                <button class="tab-btn pb-2 px-2 hover:text-slate-200" data-tab="tab-spawner">👾 Спавнер</button>
                <button class="tab-btn pb-2 px-2 hover:text-slate-200" data-tab="tab-models">📦 Модели</button>
                <button class="tab-btn pb-2 px-2 hover:text-slate-200" data-tab="tab-world">🌍 Мир</button>
                <button class="tab-btn pb-2 px-2 hover:text-slate-200" data-tab="tab-presets">💾 Проект</button>
            </div>

            <!-- Контент вкладок -->
            <div class="scrollable-panel pr-1 space-y-4 text-xs">
                
                <!-- ВКЛАДКА 1: РЕДАКТОР КАРТЫ И РАЗМЕЩЕНИЕ ОБЪЕКТОВ -->
                <div id="tab-builder" class="tab-content space-y-3">
                    <div class="p-2.5 bg-sky-950/40 border border-sky-800/40 rounded-xl space-y-1">
                        <div class="font-bold text-sky-400 flex items-center justify-between">
                            <span>Инструмент размещения (Raycast)</span>
                            <span id="editor-mode-badge" class="text-[10px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-950 text-emerald-300 font-mono font-bold">Выбор (Select)</span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">Кликните по арене для размещения или выбора объекта. Поддерживается привязка к сетке.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between bg-slate-900/60 p-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-800">
                        <span class="font-medium text-slate-300">Привязка к сетке (Snap 1.0m):</span>
                        <input type="checkbox" id="ctrl-grid-snap" checked class="w-4 h-4 rounded">
                    </div>

                    <div class="font-bold text-slate-300 pt-1">Выберите префаб для размещения:</div>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                        <button class="tool-btn py-2 px-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 border border-slate-700 text-left font-bold transition flex items-center justify-between tool-btn-active" data-tool="select">
                            <span>👆 Выделение</span>
                            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-mono">Q</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="tool-btn py-2 px-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 border border-slate-700 text-left font-bold transition flex items-center justify-between" data-tool="wall">
                            <span>🧱 Стена-укрытие</span>
                            <span class="text-[10px] text-sky-400 font-mono">Solid</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="tool-btn py-2 px-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 border border-slate-700 text-left font-bold transition flex items-center justify-between" data-tool="barrel">
                            <span>🛢️ Бочка с порохом</span>
                            <span class="text-[10px] text-rose-400 font-mono">AoE Boom</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="tool-btn py-2 px-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 border border-slate-700 text-left font-bold transition flex items-center justify-between" data-tool="crate">
                            <span>📦 Ящик с припасами</span>
                            <span class="text-[10px] text-amber-400 font-mono">Loot</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="tool-btn py-2 px-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 border border-slate-700 text-left font-bold transition flex items-center justify-between" data-tool="shrine">
                            <span>⛲ Источник здоровья</span>
                            <span class="text-[10px] text-emerald-400 font-mono">Regen</span>
                        </button>
                        <button class="tool-btn py-2 px-3 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 border border-slate-700 text-left font-bold transition flex items-center justify-between" data-tool="pillar">
                            <span>🏛️ Каменная колонна</span>
                            <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-400 font-mono">Heavy</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    <div class="pt-2 border-t border-slate-800 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2">
                        <button id="btn-clear-props" class="py-2 bg-rose-950/80 hover:bg-rose-900 border border-rose-800/60 rounded-lg font-bold text-rose-200 transition">
                            🗑️ Очистить все объекты
                        </button>
                        <button id="btn-generate-arena" class="py-2 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 rounded-lg font-bold text-white transition">
                            🎲 Случайная арена
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- ВКЛАДКА 2: ИНСПЕКТОР СУЩНОСТЕЙ -->
                <div id="tab-inspector" class="tab-content hidden space-y-3">
                    <div id="inspector-empty" class="text-center py-8 text-slate-400 space-y-2">
                        <div class="text-4xl">🔍</div>
                        <div class="font-bold">Объект не выбран</div>
                        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500">Включите инструмент «Выделение» и кликните на любой объект или героя на арене.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div id="inspector-content" class="hidden space-y-3">
                        <div class="p-2.5 bg-slate-900 rounded-xl border border-slate-800 flex justify-between items-center">
                            <div>
                                <span class="text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase font-mono">Сущность ID:</span>
                                <div id="insp-entity-name" class="font-black text-sky-400 text-sm">Стена #1</div>
                            </div>
                            <button id="btn-insp-delete" class="px-2 py-1 bg-rose-700 hover:bg-rose-600 rounded text-xs font-bold text-white">Удалить</button>
                        </div>

                        <div class="space-y-2 bg-slate-900/50 p-2.5 rounded-xl border border-slate-800/80">
                            <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider">Трансформация (Transform)</span>
                            <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2">
                                <div><label class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">X:</label><input type="number" step="0.5" id="insp-pos-x" class="w-full bg-slate-800 p-1 rounded font-mono text-center"></div>
                                <div><label class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">Y:</label><input type="number" step="0.5" id="insp-pos-y" class="w-full bg-slate-800 p-1 rounded font-mono text-center"></div>
                                <div><label class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">Z:</label><input type="number" step="0.5" id="insp-pos-z" class="w-full bg-slate-800 p-1 rounded font-mono text-center"></div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 pt-1">
                                <div><label class="text-[10px] text-slate-500">Scale X:</label><input type="number" step="0.1" id="insp-scale-x" class="w-full bg-slate-800 p-1 rounded font-mono text-center"></div>
